OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA largely
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with the chance of a
OL,7,Ffew light drizzly showers, mainly
OL,8,Facross Orkney. Any showers will
OL,9,Fgradually fade, leaving the rest of
OL,10,Fthe night dry but cloudy, chance of
OL,11,Fsome clear spells for Shetland
OL,12,Fovernight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FDry during daytime with some
OL,15,Fsunny spells for Shetland, but mainly
OL,16,Fcloudy for Orkney. Winds will be
OL,17,Flight, but strengthening in the
OL,18,Fevening ahead of overnight rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
