OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FChangeable and often windy, with
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain,
OL,8,Fpossibly quite a wet day for Orkney on
OL,9,FTuesday. Staying quite cool for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
